    <tib>de bzhin gshegs pa thaMd kyis dgongs pa lung bstan pa/ rnalyor chen po'i gsang ba rnaMr phye ba/ /rnalyor spyod pa'i sa/ /dpal rdoe 'phreng ba'i mngon par brjod pa/ /rta mchog rol pa'i lung/ /rgyud thaMd kyi snying po/ /dbang chen 'dus pa'i rgyud zhes bya ba</tib>
    <skt>sarba ta thA ga ta sin+ng+ha bya ka ra mahA yo ga gu h+ye pi b+ha ga /yo ga tsa r+ya b+hu mi shrI badzra ma le a b+hi ng+ha na i de g+ho ra wa shang a ga ma/ tan+t+ra sarba h+ri da ya/ mahA she ka sa mA dza tan+t+ra nA ma</skt>
    <coloph>rgyud kyi rgyal po dbang chen 'dus pa zhes bya ba rdzogs so// //rgya gar gyi pan t.i ta pad+ma 'byung gnas dang/ / bod kyi lo ts+tsha ba bha sang shi ta dang/ /ngan laM rgyal ba mchog dbyangs dang/ lcogs ros bsgyur cing gtan la phab pa'o// // bkra shis shog/ //dge'o// //zhal gro// sarba mangga laM</coloph>
